# Test Runner

Purpose:
  Test the chain graph system with minimal tokens.

Test Cases:
  TC1: Token tracking
    Input: "Test prompt"
    Expected: projects/sddra.ai/tokens/P1.sdd created
    Budget: <= 5000 tokens

  TC2: Chain graph
    Input: Full flow
    Expected: All arms return to D0
    Budget: <= 70000 tokens

  TC3: Human gates
    Input: Any arm
    Expected: Human approval required
    Budget: N/A

  TC4: Minimal context
    Input: P1 only
    Expected: Only P1 files loaded
    Budget: <= 2000 tokens

  TC5: Error recovery
    Input: Failing stage
    Expected: Retry 3x, then escalate
    Budget: N/A

Run:
  python scripts/test_chain.py --case TC1
  python scripts/test_chain.py --case TC2
  python scripts/test_chain.py --case TC3
  python scripts/test_chain.py --case TC4
   python scripts/test_chain.py --case TC5

State: +
